cookie-s2-h2 = 2. What Are Cookies?
cookie-s2-p1 = Cookies are small data files placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website or use an application. They are widely used to make websites and applications work, or work more efficiently, as well as to provide reporting information.
cookie-s2-p2 = Cookies set by the website owner (in this case, Jissicko Software) are called "first-party cookies". Cookies set by parties other than the website owner are called "third-party cookies". Third-party cookies enable third-party features or functionality to be provided on or through the website (e.g., analytics, advertising, interactive content).
cookie-s2-p3 = Cookies can remain on your device for different periods. "Session cookies" exist only while your browser is open and are deleted automatically once you close your browser. "Persistent cookies" survive after your browser is closed and can be used by the website to recognize your computer when you return.
cookie-s3-h2 = 3. Why Do We Use Cookies?
cookie-s3-p1 = We use first-party and third-party cookies for several reasons. Some cookies are required for technical reasons in order for our Service to operate – these are referred to as "necessary" or "essential" cookies. Other cookies enable us to track usage patterns and enhance the experience on our Service (Analytics), and potentially to help deliver relevant marketing messages (Marketing).
cookie-s4-h2-prefix = 4. Types of Cookies Used on
cookie-s4-p1 = We classify the cookies used on our Service as follows:
cookie-s4-li1-title = Necessary Cookies:
cookie-s4-li1-text-prefix = These are strictly necessary to provide you with the core services available through
cookie-s4-li1-text-suffix =  and to use some of its essential features, such as secure login, session management, and security functions. Because these cookies are strictly necessary to deliver the Service, you cannot refuse them without impacting how the Service functions. You can block or delete them by changing your browser settings (see Section 7 below), but this may affect Service functionality.
cookie-s4-li2-title = Analytics Cookies (Performance Cookies):
cookie-s4-li2-text-prefix = These cookies collect information about how you use our Service, for instance, which features you use most often, how long you spend on certain tasks, and if you receive error messages. This information helps us understand usage patterns, improve the performance and usability of
cookie-s4-li2-text-suffix = , and enhance our AI models. We use Google Analytics for this purpose. These cookies are only placed and used if you provide your consent via our cookie management tool.
cookie-s4-li3-title = Marketing Cookies (Targeting Cookies):
cookie-s4-li3-text = These cookies may be used to understand user interests, track the effectiveness of our own marketing campaigns (e.g., user acquisition), or potentially work with advertising partners (like Meta/Facebook) to show you relevant ads on other platforms. These cookies record your visit to our Service and potentially your browsing activity elsewhere. These cookies are only placed and used if you provide your consent via our cookie management tool.
