cookie-s7-h2 = 7. Your Choices and Managing Cookies
cookie-s7-p1 = You have the right to decide whether to accept or reject cookies other than Necessary cookies.
cookie-s7-li1-title = Cookie Consent Tool:
cookie-s7-li1-text = When you first visit our Service, you will be presented with a cookie banner allowing you to accept all cookies, reject non-essential cookies, or manage your preferences for specific categories (Analytics, Marketing). You can typically change your preferences at any time by clicking on a "Cookie Settings" or "Manage Consent" link or button (usually found in the website footer). [Ensure such a link/button exists and is functional]. Rejecting cookies via this tool will prevent Analytics and Marketing cookies from being set or used going forward.
cookie-s7-li2-title = Browser Settings:
cookie-s7-li2-text = Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings preferences. You can set your browser to block or delete cookies. However, if you block all cookies (including Necessary ones), you may not be able to access all or parts of our Service, and some functionality may be impaired. Find out how to manage cookies on popular browsers:
